<title>UK: CRICKET-AUSTRALIA 213-7 V ENGLAND (77) IN SECOND TEST - CLOSE.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-AUSTRALIA 213-7 V ENGLAND (77) IN SECOND TEST - CLOSE.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-06-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Australia were 213 for seven in</p>
<p>reply to England's first innings score of 77, a lead of 136 at</p>
<p>close of play on the fourth day of the second test at Lord's on</p>
<p>Sunday.</p>
</text>
